# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for the tsan test preset: races inside third-party code we
# don't build with TSan and can't fix. Never suppress a race in our own code here; fix it.
#
# Mesa's llvmpipe (lavapipe, the CI driver) destroys a fence's mutex and condition variable
# while its rasterizer threads may still touch them (lp_fence.c).
race:lp_fence_destroy
